11 November 2026, Android 17 / API 37, Go QA 8087405 and isolated PostgreSQL 18.
LocalScanRecoveryTest#rejectsInvalidAdviceAndKeepsSpecialHandlingManual

CameraX uploaded one image. A controlled loopback worker returned malformed
JSON, an invalid method enum, a malformed evidence list and a READY response
without sources. Go rejected all four with HTTP 503 / INVALID_AI_RESPONSE. Android showed the
recommendation error, retained the cleanliness choice on explicit retry and
never offered the action to apply a recommendation.

The user flagged sharp or broken material. The worker returned a sourced
special-handling response and Go returned HTTP 200 with method=null.
Android showed Panduan penanganan khusus and the linked source. Input manual opened the editor
without an AI reference, and the account stayed at zero records and 0 XP.

Instrumentation: Time: 27.999; OK (1 test).
This run controlled worker responses. It did not invoke the public AI provider.
